{"1983790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legion: Arcane Origins", "steam_appid": 1983790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/7dbdc44d5eec6cc91b40bf8f7c0900cc.apng?t=1787497903\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/7dbdc44d5eec6cc91b40bf8f7c0900cc.poster.avif?t=1787497903\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/47acaada7a2978b83b768f93e13a4871.avif?t=1787497903\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legion: Arcane Origins is a dungeon crawler where you go on adventure to find your lost memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous battles, intriguing story and wholesome treasures await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/cdb0fa95bf0e0bda3aeee377b132e95e.poster.avif?t=1787497903\" width=580 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/cdb0fa95bf0e0bda3aeee377b132e95e.webm?t=1787497903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/1f423b820313c00f90006ba9d2283134.avif?t=1787497903\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many different characters</strong><br>As you explore deeper, you will unlock new characters.<br>And they will join the quest for the lost memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of different items</strong><br>Figure out what they do, collect them wisely and become stronger. <br>Also unlock even more items and other features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn magic or wield weapons</strong><br>You'll have to find them first.<br>And then you'll have to learn how to use them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanquish great many enemies</strong><br>While a lone goblin doesn't pose much threat,<br>a pack of them backed by other monsters will be the most deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slay the champions</strong><br>There is at least one on each and every floor,<br>they won't let you pass peacefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and trade Steam Inventory items</strong><br>Or use them to craft something for your next journey.<br>Or just display them on your Steam Profile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visually calm cute style</strong><br>Don't like being overwhelmed with too much visual fluff? <br>Me neither, so you can expect the game to look clean and clear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/fdab84360f99d0b1e572ee5117c5831b.avif?t=1787497903\" width=192 height=128 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/7dbdc44d5eec6cc91b40bf8f7c0900cc.apng?t=1787497903\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/7dbdc44d5eec6cc91b40bf8f7c0900cc.poster.avif?t=1787497903\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/47acaada7a2978b83b768f93e13a4871.avif?t=1787497903\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legion: Arcane Origins is a dungeon crawler where you go on adventure to find your lost memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous battles, intriguing story and wholesome treasures await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/cdb0fa95bf0e0bda3aeee377b132e95e.poster.avif?t=1787497903\" width=580 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/cdb0fa95bf0e0bda3aeee377b132e95e.webm?t=1787497903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983790/extras/1f423b820313c00f90006ba9d2283134.avif?t=1787497903\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many different characters</strong><br>As you explore deeper, you will unlock new characters.<br>And they will join the quest for the lost memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of different items</strong><br>Figure out what they do, collect them wisely and become stronger. <br>Also unlock even more items and other features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn magic or wield weapons</strong><br>You'll have to find them first.<br>And then you'll have to learn how to use them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_parag